  :y :PROP_Y}
 :render
 {:canvas {:h 480 :w 800}
  :dpi 160
  :render-ticks 3
  :theme-tier-note
  "greater_res >= 720 is REQUIRED for DISP_LARGE (RADIUS_DEFAULT=12 / PAD_DEF=24 — the tier this whole mission targets). The theme tier is recomputed from the live display resolution at init; a canvas below 720px on its greater axis silently renders DISP_MEDIUM. 800x480 pins DISP_LARGE and fits every card (largest cells: table 480x240, tabview 460x320, scale vertical 56x360)."
  :tick-ms 16}
